  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Forced Migration Review 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the development cooperation is to stimulate debate and engagement on issues related to saving lives and responding to missing migrants with an aim to change policies and practices focused on saving lives on dangerous migrant routes and also better practice and policy related to those who perish and their families.

MIGSTAB will base the actual support on progress attained in the implementation of the project as described in the documentation provided by the Grantee or in this jointly agreed document. Progress will be measured through the FMR&#x2019;s monitoring framework.</narrative>
  </description>
